{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ea49eb724cd90c00ab7ef6a357a9264cc124c83ea2722b62e7b8ac8bc92c9fa6", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の企画で、\n美奈子はビーチカフェの一日店員をしている……）", "zh": "（在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的企划中，\n美奈子正在海滩咖啡店体验一天店员的工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "ffcad236358f92cee964a57631cf089bb79a5eda1a5edca9d4b366bdf95b7cd7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nどうでしたか？　私の店員姿！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n感觉怎么样？我当服务员的样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1002_p", "source_sha256": "50a1bf927e617b24b450131264736505455b7d009f2b3f188a8ea05d7b273989", "ja": "すごくよかったよ。美奈子の衣装もそうだけど、\nお店や料理も雰囲気があって、南国に来た気分だよ。", "zh": "非常棒。不只是美奈子的服装，店里的布置和料理也很有氛围，让我感觉像是来到了热带地区。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "0b7a5d53eb5681451df95ab5724024168bb18104606854182de59251a4d42d04", "ja": "本当ですか！？\nよかった～……一生懸命、頑張った甲斐がありました。", "zh": "真的吗！？\n太好了～……我这么努力总算没有白费。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "f906c650f67c27362b7dbf0c72ddfb7339362d2486ac404a1e91a0f293afb735", "ja": "ほら、お店もお料理もオシャレじゃないですか！\nだから、雰囲気を壊さないようにしなきゃって思って。", "zh": "你看，店里和料理都很时尚吧！\n所以我就想着，不能破坏这里的氛围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1005_p", "source_sha256": "67dfdfacafec3b4f2b4587b6068d33eaaf251e20bc59889f3d76ce7df0fd3728", "ja": "そうだったのか。料理やドリンクを運ぶ姿が\n自然だったから気づかなかったよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。看你端菜和饮料的样子那么自然，我都没注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "f15d0cc5953c1078fbd7b4da51a016fd0db9809048e7009844f7042f6c9aaf8c", "ja": "それは、看板娘の意地です！　だって美味しいものを\nオススメするなら、それなりのおもてなしをしないと！", "zh": "那可是招牌女儿的坚持！毕竟要推荐美味的东西，就得拿出相应的待客之道才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "b847317ce0b33518aa930b2b8906754906e71773c146cc247de641435627c1a1", "ja": "本番前に、お店のお料理をいただいたんですけど。\nそれが本当に美味しくて！", "zh": "正式演出前，我品尝了一下店里的料理。\n真的特别好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "8d5ecf1337cf0ce88268d773c934a45033c73cc164f6d7fb32e75ce2f05c5e21", "ja": "でもスタッフさんに聞いたら、テーブルにのる分\nしか用意してないって言われて……残念です。", "zh": "可是我问了工作人员，他们说只准备了摆上桌的那一份……真遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1009_p", "source_sha256": "52de4404ebe0882e4649f23df509454dcc1b308cc480b15d44750d6d8fde192e", "ja": "まあ、写真は美奈子が主役だからな。\nって、それでも結構な量があった気がするけど？", "zh": "毕竟照片里的主角是美奈子嘛。\n不过，我记得就算那样也已经相当多手笔了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "6e6088f3f9162a797e40f2a958c5952a95996c818bc5c49f8344330e68b87c5d", "ja": "あんな量じゃ、全然カロリーが足りないです！\n海に来たら、いっぱい体力を使いますよね？", "zh": "就那么点分量，热量完全不够呀！\n既然来到了海边，就会消耗很多体力对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "2be92ad03620b6641472caf76f3d359d63a38ba77e1d1f69399d884f80865d03", "ja": "体力がなくなったら、思いきり楽しめませんよね？\nだから、海を楽しむためにもカロリーは大事です！", "zh": "没了体力，就没法尽情享受了吧？\n所以，为了享受大海，摄取热量很重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1012_p", "source_sha256": "27ef5ba639c83fd5715c169a88075adfe1242a55b5cee4870ea110090b53afd4", "ja": "は、はい……？", "zh": "在、在……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "d86c6c775162ca904bc10da1c3e6af5fe2da0fca7a973b6e595c62de724b3a36", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、お店の全メニューを\n食べてほしかったんですけど、また今度にします。", "zh": "本来还想让{$P$}先生把店里的菜品\n都尝个遍呢，不过还是改天再说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0393_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "cfb86fe8c156f6b22ca35df65d21dced63c175a7a43326d1d979ab3ae0624a4e", "ja": "だから、また一緒に、ここに来ましょうね。\n今度はお仕事抜きで……えへへ♪", "zh": "所以，下次我们再一起到这里来吧。\n这次就不谈工作了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
